FINAL ANSWER:
**Troy Goode** is the best reviewer for `lib/index.js`.

- **History:** Troy has 29 of the file's commits, far more than anyone else. Troy also made the most recent real change, "lib: annotate handlers" on 2026-04-10.
- **Second reviewer:** Douglas Christopher Wilson has 4 commits, but the last was in 2017. Alejandro Caravaca Puchades also has 4. I didn't check when those were made.
- **Ignore Fiona Formatter:** their only commit on the file is the 2026-04-12 reformat, and `.git-blame-ignore-revs` already excludes it.
- **No CODEOWNERS:** the repo has no CODEOWNERS file, so this comes from git history only. History shows who has edited the file, not who is currently responsible for it.

Only two commits touch the file in the last 18 months, and one of them is the reformat. So Troy is the only recent contributor.

